# NOT library/: the curated default parts live there and both stages need them
# — the SPA compiles them in (src/core/library/bundledLibrary.ts) and the
# runtime seeds /data/lib with them. Excluding it built an image that had no
# parts at all, in which every shipped example failed with "unknown subckt".
# User drop-ins are kept out of git by library/.gitignore, not from here.
